# Global AI Missions — Docker build context (delivery-engineer).
# Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile copies reaches the build context.
*
!backend/
!frontend/
!content/
!docs/contracts/*.schema.json
!docker/entrypoint.sh

# Never in the image: secrets, local environments, dependencies, build and test outputs.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/blob-report
frontend/e2e/.auth
backend/tests
**/.DS_Store
